<mxCell id="h6c51" value="&lt;b&gt;have[ch] &amp;lt; needed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A Counter returns 0 for a missing key, so a letter the rack lacks fails the test without a KeyError. Spare tiles (the a) never matter." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="140" width="300" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
